---
source: tests/info_read.rs
expression: "section_ddl(&info, section)"
---
audited: DEFINE FIELD audited ON account TYPE string PERMISSIONS FOR select NONE, FOR create, update WHERE $auth.admin = true
author: DEFINE FIELD author ON account TYPE record<user> REFERENCE ON DELETE CASCADE PERMISSIONS FULL
contact: DEFINE FIELD contact ON account TYPE string DEFAULT 'unknown@example.com' ASSERT string::is_email($value) COMMENT 'The contact address' PERMISSIONS FULL
da: DEFINE FIELD da ON account TYPE array<string> DEFAULT ALWAYS [] PERMISSIONS FULL
da.*: DEFINE FIELD da.* ON account TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL
derived: DEFINE FIELD derived ON account COMPUTED string::uppercase(name) PERMISSIONS FULL
display: DEFINE FIELD display ON account TYPE string GRAPHQL_ALIAS 'displayName' PERMISSIONS FULL
fcp: DEFINE FIELD fcp ON account TYPE string COMPUTED 1 + 1 PERMISSIONS FOR select WHERE meta = 1, FOR create, update FULL
fvd: DEFINE FIELD fvd ON account TYPE string DEFAULT 2 VALUE 1 ASSERT 3 > 2 PERMISSIONS FULL
id: DEFINE FIELD id ON account TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL
locked: DEFINE FIELD locked ON account TYPE bool READONLY VALUE true PERMISSIONS FULL
meta2: DEFINE FIELD meta2 ON account TYPE object FLEXIBLE PERMISSIONS FULL
name: DEFINE FIELD name ON account TYPE string PERMISSIONS FULL
optf: DEFINE FIELD optf ON account TYPE none | string PERMISSIONS FULL
owner: DEFINE FIELD owner ON account TYPE record<user> REFERENCE ON DELETE IGNORE PERMISSIONS FULL
parent: DEFINE FIELD parent ON account TYPE record<page> REFERENCE ON DELETE THEN (CREATE cleanup_log SET at = time::now()) PERMISSIONS FULL
secret: DEFINE FIELD secret ON account TYPE string PERMISSIONS FOR select, create, update NONE
shout: DEFINE FIELD shout ON account TYPE string COMPUTED string::uppercase(name) PERMISSIONS FULL
